config I225_V
    tristate "Intel I225-V / I226-V 2.5GbE Ethernet"
    default y
    help
      Native PCIe Ethernet for Intel I225-V (8086:15f3) and I226-V
      (8086:125c). The driver uses one RX/TX queue and the existing network
      device interface. MSI notifies the network service when available;
      otherwise the driver uses polling.
      Frame processing always runs in task context.
      Other I225 and I226 variants are not matched. Builds i225.ko when modular.
